  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expansion of Kyanja Urban Agricultural Resource Center</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to expand the capacity of the Kyanja Urban Agriculture Resource Center, which is fully owned and operated by the Kampala Capital City Authority (KCCA). The center trains urban farmers and supplies high-quality inputs. Demand for inputs is ever expanding and the center is no longer able to keep up with increased demand. The aim of this project is to develop the feasibility studies to expand Kyanja centre and recommend on marketing strategies to support urban farmers in Kampala.</narrative>
  </description>
